  const user = authenticate(token)
  if (!user) {
    throw new Error('Unauthorized')
  }
  const newUser = await db.user.create({ data })
  return newUser
}
```

## Reference

See the [React documentation](https://react.dev/reference/rsc/use-server) for more information on `use server`.

